# Installed, never committed — the app itself vendors what it needs and has
# no runtime dependency. This is only for the figure-rasterising dev tool.
node_modules/

# Instrument output. Everything here is DERIVED and reproducible by running
# the tool; committing it would bloat the history and invite someone to edit
# a PNG that a re-render then silently overwrites.
*.zip

# ⚠️ NEVER COMMIT THESE. The Kartverket DEM tiles ARE shipped (NLOD / CC BY
# 4.0 permits it, with attribution). Orthophotography is different: licensed
# education-and-research
# only and may not be redistributed; site photographs are held back pending a
# GDPR review. The patterns are here as a backstop, not as permission to put
# them in the working tree.
**/ortho*.tif
**/ortho*.tiff
**/*.aux.xml
**/IMG_*.jpg
**/IMG_*.jpeg

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
~$*
